# Eitri MCU firmware: X-Plus 4 MAINBOARD ([mcu U_1], /dev/ttyS0). Minimal Klipper/Kalico Kconfig input; expand with
# `make olddefconfig` (mcu/build-mcu.sh does, out of tree). Identical for Klipper and Kalico (checked in
# mcu/tests/test_configs.py against both pinned trees).
#
# Parameters and how they were derived: mcu/params.json. Status: RESOLVED, confidence "likely".
#   chip        STM32F401 -> CONFIG_MCU="stm32f401xc", 84 MHz (live klippy.log)
#   offset      32 KiB stock bootloader at 0x08000000 -> application at 0x08008000 (STM32_FLASH_START_8000).
#               Never write 0x08000000-0x08007FFF.
#   clock       8 MHz external crystal (PH0/PH1 are reserved in the live dictionary)
#   serial      USART1 PA10/PA9 at 500000 baud
CONFIG_LOW_LEVEL_OPTIONS=y
CONFIG_MACH_STM32=y
CONFIG_MACH_STM32F401=y
CONFIG_STM32_FLASH_START_8000=y
CONFIG_STM32_CLOCK_REF_8M=y
CONFIG_STM32_SERIAL_USART1=y
CONFIG_SERIAL_BAUD=500000
